Last night, Metro police officers stood alongside elected officials, Officer Austin Abdelnabi’s family, friends, and community members for a candlelight vigil honoring his life.

In the midst of an incredibly difficult time, those gathered chose to remember the light Officer Abdelnabi brought to the world through his service, kindness, and sacrifice. 💙🕯️

